  "remarks": "Limited Liability Company “Asset Electro” is a Russian company which is part of the ABS Electro Group of companies, and which is involved in developing and manufacturing electronic and radio-electronic components. It shares the same managing and ownership structure as Limited Liability Company “Asset Automation”, the company the trademark under which the ABS Electro group of companies operate. ABS Electro group notably includes JSC VNIIR-Progress, a Russian research and development institute that produces the Kometa antenna used in devices such as the Shahed and Geran unmanned aerial vehicle and guided bomb kits to enhance their resistance against electronic interference. JSC “Sokol Asset”, which owns JSC VNIIR-Progress, and Limited Liability Company “Asset Electro” share the same address. JSC VNIIR-Progress and Limited Liability Company “Asset Automation” are subject to Union restrictive measures.",
